            "description": {
              "value": "You developed a method to chemically purify and consecrate your bombs on the fly.\n\nYou include this additive mixture when crafting your alchemist's fire or ghost charge.\n\nThe created bomb deals 1d4 persistent positive damage in addition to whatever damage it would normally cause. As usual for positive damage, this damage harms only undead and creatures with negative healing."
